  ],
  "Then hear the last of it. You didn’t just beat a table tonight. You made it OUT. The porch, the corner, the basement, my room — those are behind you now, and they stay yours. What’s ahead is the other game. The ranked rooms. The televised tables. The league with its numbers and its lights.": [
   800235,
   15600
  ],
  "Go be professional at them, little one. That world grades everything and forgives nothing, and it has no idea what the block sent it. …Dee. When they ask where you learned — and they WILL ask — say the route. Say it proud.": [
   816085,
   11230
  ],
  "And Dee. Your daddy’s name is spoken kindly on every table of this route again. You did that. Not the crown — YOU. Now go home and call your mama before the street does. Champions first. Stories after.": [
   827565,
